<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>OldBirds - 个人简介</title>
    <link href="/third/bootstrap-5.3.6/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet" />
    <style>
        body {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f8fafc 0%, #e0e7ef 100%);
        }
        .avatar-animate {
            animation: floatY 2.5s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px 0 rgba(31, 38, 135, 0.15);
        }
        @keyframes floatY {
            from { transform: translateY(0); }
            to { transform: translateY(-16px); }
        }
        .section-card {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.95);
            border-radius: 1rem;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
            padding: 2rem 2rem 1.5rem 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            transition: box-shadow 0.3s;
        }
        .section-card:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 4px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
        }
        .fade-in {
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(30px);
            animation: fadeInUp 1s forwards;
        }
        .fade-in.delay-1 { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
        .fade-in.delay-2 { animation-delay: 0.4s; }
        .fade-in.delay-3 { animation-delay: 0.6s; }
        .fade-in.delay-4 { animation-delay: 0.8s; }
        @keyframes fadeInUp {
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: none;
            }
        }
        .media-list {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 1.5rem;
            padding-left: 0;
            list-style: none;
        }
        .media-item {
            flex: 1 1 220px;
            min-width: 220px;
            max-width: 320px;
            background: #fff;
            border-radius: 1rem;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 1rem;
            transition: box-shadow 0.3s;
        }
        .media-item:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.10);
        }
        .media-logo {
            width: 56px;
            height: 56px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            object-fit: cover;
            margin-right: 1rem;
            background: #f3f6fa;
        }
        .media-cover {
            width: 72px;
            height: 72px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            object-fit: cover;
            margin-right: 1rem;
            background: #f3f6fa;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="d-flex flex-column min-vh-100 bg-light">
    <header class="navbar navbar-light bg-white shadow-sm px-3">
        <span class="navbar-brand fw-bold fs-3">OldBirds</span>
        <a href="/page/posts" class="btn btn-primary ms-auto">前往博客系统</a>
    </header>
    <div class="container py-5" style="max-width: 900px;">
        <div class="text-center mb-5 fade-in">
            <img src="/imgs/oldbirds.png" alt="头像" class="rounded-circle avatar-animate" width="130" height="130">
            <h1 class="mt-4 mb-1 fw-bold" style="letter-spacing:2px;">OldBirds</h1>
            <p class="text-muted fs-5">全栈开发者 | 技术布道者 | 奶爸一枚</p>
        </div>
        <div class="section-card fade-in delay-1">
            <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">个人简介</h4>
            <p class="mb-0 fs-6">
                热爱技术与创新，专注于 Web、移动端和云原生开发。喜欢分享、乐于开源，致力于用代码改变世界。<br>
                目前专注于高效开发工具、极简产品和技术内容创作。
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="section-card fade-in delay-2">
            <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">联系方式</h4>
            <ul class="list-unstyled fs-6 mb-0">
                <li class="mb-1">📧 邮箱：<a href="mailto:oheroj@email.com">oheroj@email.com</a></li>
                <li class="mb-1">💬 微信：oheroj</li>
                <li class="mb-1">🐙 GitHub：<a href="https://github.com/oheroj" target="_blank">oheroj</a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="section-card fade-in delay-3">
            <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">自媒体</h4>
            <ul class="list-unstyled fs-6 mb-0">
                <li class="mb-1">掘金：<a href="https://juejin.cn/user/325111172054350" target="_blank">OldBirds</a></li>
                <li class="mb-1">微信公众号：OldBirds</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="section-card fade-in delay-4">
            <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">我的产品</h4>
            <ul class="media-list mb-0">
                <li class="media-item">
                    <img src="/imgs/idiray-cover.png" alt="iDiray Logo" class="media-logo">
                    <div>
                        <div class="fw-bold">iDiray</div>
                        <div class="text-muted small mb-1">基于 Git 存储的原子笔记 App</div>
                        <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=run.oldbird.idiary&pli=1" target="_blank" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary">官网</a>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li class="media-item">
                    <img src="/imgs/panda-cover.png" alt="Panda Logo" class="media-logo">
                    <div>
                        <div class="fw-bold">Panda</div>
                        <div class="text-muted small mb-1">基于 TinyPNG 图片压缩神器 App</div>
                        <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=run.oldbird.panda" target="_blank" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary">官网</a>
                    </div>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="section-card fade-in delay-4">
            <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">我的课程</h4>
            <ul class="media-list mb-0">
                <li class="media-item">
                    <img src="/imgs/vaporblog-cover.png" alt="VaporBlog 课程封面" class="media-cover">
                    <div>
                        <div class="fw-bold">VaporBlog</div>
                        <div class="text-muted small mb-1">基于 Vapor 的极简博客系统</div>
                        <a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/appmsgalbum?__biz=MzI4MDM2MDAzOA==&action=getalbum&album_id=4011584829035593730&from_itemidx=1&from_msgid=2247486416#wechat_redirect" target="_blank" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-success">《Swift Vapor 实战》</a>
                    </div>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
    <script src="/third/bootstrap-5.3.6/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>